      "offsetInSection": 276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Flo, flooo!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10046006C006F002C00200066006C006F006F006F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Sabes qué es lo que más me gustaría ahora?\nVer a estas cinco preciosuras combatir a la vez.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Necesito algo que me inspire a crear nuevos\ntintes de pelo!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004E006500630065007300690074006F00200061006C0067006F00200071007500650020006D006500200069006E00730070006900720065002000610020006300720065006100720020006E007500650076006F0073000A00740069006E007400650073002000640065002000700065006C006F002100100002011401740000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Podrías ayudarme?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSolo te pido que luches contra mis cinco Floette\nal mismo tiempo.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si te animas, ya sabes dónde encontrarme.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006900200074006500200061006E0069006D00610073002C0020007900610020007300610062006500730020006400F3006E0064006500200065006E0063006F006E0074007200610072006D0065002E00100002011401740000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Te animas a enfrentarte a mis cinco Floette\nal mismo tiempo?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0054006500200061006E0069006D006100730020006100200065006E006600720065006E00740061007200740065002000610020006D00690073002000630069006E0063006F00200046006C006F0065007400740065000A0061006C0020006D00690073006D006F0020007400690065006D0070006F003F00100002011401740000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Por supuesto!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
